  "title": "Grumman AA-5B Tiger — Emergency Procedures",
  "description": "Emergency procedures for the Grumman AA-5B Tiger with Lycoming O-360 carbureted engine. Memory items are marked accordingly. Contains no numeric limitations; all airspeeds must come from the specific aircraft POH. This is an aide-memoire only — aviate first, then navigate and communicate. The O-360 is carbureted; carburetor icing is applicable and included.",
  "aircraft": {
